===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|XY}}====
Several Team Flare Grunts debuted in ''[[XY094|From A to Z!]]''. They were led by [[Mable]] during their search for {{p|Zygarde}} in [[Terminus Cave]]. Mable and the Grunts were unable to capture Zygarde as it used {{m|Land's Wrath}} to get away. The Team Flare Grunts were later seen with [[Celosia]], this time when [[Squishy]] went running off from {{Ash}}, {{ashfr}}, and [[Sawyer]]. The Grunts and Celosia battled Ash and his friends, but were unable to finish the battle as Ash and his friends retreated via a distraction caused by {{AP|Pikachu}}'s {{m|Electro Ball}}. The Team Flare Grunts found the group as they were by the campsite looking for Squishy as it ran off again. While Ash and Sawyer dealt with Celosia, Ash had his friends take Squishy to safety. [[Bryony]] and her set of Team Flare Grunts later found Squishy by a rock on a river. Squishy transformed into its {{DL|List of Pokémon with form differences|Zygarde|10% Forme}} and sent Bryony and her set of Grunts packing.

In ''[[XY102|Meeting at Terminus Cave!]]'', a set of Team Flare Grunts stood by Terminus Cave along with Celosia and Bryony awaiting for Squishy's arrival. After Ash and his friends went into the cave, Team Flare came out of hiding. The Grunts battled the group once more, but were defeated by Squishy's 10% Forme, although this allowed Squishy to separate from the group as a result.

In ''[[XY107|An Explosive Operation!]]'', the Team Flare Grunts battled [[Z2]], who soon transformed into its 10% and 50% Formes. They were about to lose until [[Alain]] arrived per [[Lysandre]]'s request. Alain then proceeded to battle Z2 with his {{TP|Alain|Charizard}}. The battle distracted Z2 long enough for Team Flare to use their specialized weapons to weaken it back to its Zygarde Core Forme. They then took the Core into their custody.

A Grunt appeared in ''[[XY132|A Towering Takeover!]]'', where he tried to capture Mairin, but was stopped by Professor Sycamore.

In ''[[XY133|Coming Apart at the Dreams!]]'', Grunts were seen in the security room of Lysandre Labs. Two of them in the Lumiose Gym were revealed to have been defeated by {{an|Clemont}} when he went to the Gym in order to retrieve it.

As Clemont and Clembot went in the Gym in ''[[XY134|The Right Hero for the Right Job!]]'', Xerosic and two Grunts saw their arrival. Clemont took care of the two Grunts with his {{TP|Clemont|Luxray}} using {{m|Electric Terrain}} on them. Another group of Grunts appeared in the episode with Mable where they battled {{Steven}} and his {{TP|Steven|Metagross}}. After {{an|Serena}}, [[Mairin]] and [[Professor Sycamore]] rescued [[Chespie]], more Grunts appeared as they blocked their path. It wasn't long until Steven arrived with Metagross and Metagross's {{m|Psychic}} lifted the Grunts in the air.

In ''[[XY135|Rocking Kalos Defenses!]]'', they were seen evacuating Lysandre Labs as the [[Giant Rock]]'s transformation into its Zygarde form resulted in the building being destroyed.

